# examples/regressions/encode_surrogate_reject — the SM-STRU32 (crumb 0025) codec fixture. Proves
# `teko::text::encode_u32_utf8` rejects a UTF-16 surrogate codepoint (U+D800) with `error` instead
# of emitting an invalid byte sequence. A SELF-CONTAINED project (its own local copy of the encode
# path under `src/text/text.tks`), same rationale as `examples/regressions/arena_loadstore`.
